{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Ollie is an octopus living in the ocean. He has eight arms, and each arm can bend, reach, and explore.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.46,0.58],[0.64,0.73],[0.81,1.44],[1.53,1.87],[1.94,2.03],[2.08,2.17],[2.26,2.89],[3.27,3.4],[3.47,3.65],[3.79,4.09],[4.17,4.7],[4.75,4.93],[5.03,5.31],[5.39,5.69],[5.77,5.96],[6.09,6.68],[7.06,7.46],[7.51,7.7],[7.77,8.82]]},{"text":"On Ollie’s arms are suction cups. They help him hold onto rocks and pick up shells without dropping them.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.29,0.69],[0.77,1.1],[1.16,1.32],[1.37,1.82],[1.92,2.48],[2.87,3.09],[3.17,3.4],[3.47,3.59],[3.67,4],[4.08,4.32],[4.41,4.75],[4.79,4.91],[4.99,5.22],[5.28,5.41],[5.49,5.9],[5.96,6.34],[6.38,6.82],[6.88,7.52]]},{"text":"Ollie hides in a rocky home called a den. It keeps him safe from strong waves and hungry animals.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.38,0.69],[0.74,0.81],[0.87,0.89],[0.97,1.31],[1.39,1.72],[1.79,2.13],[2.17,2.19],[2.28,2.83],[3.22,3.38],[3.45,3.76],[3.81,3.92],[4.02,4.37],[4.41,4.6],[4.68,5.08],[5.18,5.58],[5.64,5.78],[5.86,6.28],[6.36,7.34]]},{"text":"Sometimes Ollie changes color. He can look more like sand or rocks to help him stay hidden.","words":[[0,0.63],[0.7,0.96],[1.02,1.47],[1.56,2.14],[2.46,2.59],[2.65,2.8],[2.87,3.09],[3.16,3.42],[3.5,3.75],[3.82,4.2],[4.28,4.4],[4.47,4.84],[4.91,5.03],[5.12,5.35],[5.42,5.54],[5.61,5.89],[5.96,6.69]]},{"text":"Ollie sees a fish swim by. He stays still, blending in, because hiding is a smart ocean skill.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.38,0.63],[0.69,0.73],[0.82,1.14],[1.22,1.53],[1.61,2.07],[2.39,2.53],[2.59,2.94],[2.98,3.48],[3.55,4.08],[4.18,4.53],[4.85,5.22],[5.28,5.68],[5.75,5.86],[5.92,5.97],[6.05,6.48],[6.56,6.95],[7.04,7.85]]},{"text":"If danger comes close, Ollie can squirt a dark cloud of ink. The ink helps him sneak away quickly.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.28,0.61],[0.69,0.96],[1.04,1.5],[1.54,1.8],[1.85,2.01],[2.08,2.53],[2.58,2.6],[2.67,2.96],[3.02,3.38],[3.44,3.53],[3.63,4.09],[4.61,4.77],[4.87,5.08],[5.16,5.47],[5.53,5.65],[5.74,6.09],[6.15,6.4],[6.49,7.38]]},{"text":"Ollie moves by jetting water from his body. It pushes him forward like a quick underwater zoom.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.43,0.82],[0.91,1.06],[1.14,1.49],[1.57,1.9],[1.96,2.16],[2.23,2.36],[2.44,3],[3.38,3.55],[3.65,4.06],[4.13,4.28],[4.39,5.06],[5.21,5.49],[5.54,5.56],[5.7,6.01],[6.12,6.82],[6.91,7.71]]},{"text":"At night, Ollie hunts for food like crabs and small fish. He uses his arms to grab gently.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.28,0.59],[0.64,0.91],[0.97,1.26],[1.32,1.49],[1.57,1.87],[1.93,2.14],[2.19,2.65],[2.69,2.81],[2.88,3.23],[3.31,3.8],[4.32,4.46],[4.54,4.9],[4.97,5.13],[5.21,5.6],[5.65,5.75],[5.83,6.11],[6.19,7.06]]},{"text":"Ollie tastes with his arms and explores with touch. Ocean animals use many senses to learn.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.4,0.79],[0.85,1.04],[1.09,1.24],[1.33,1.75],[1.81,1.95],[2.03,2.62],[2.67,2.87],[2.94,3.53],[4.05,4.46],[4.53,4.98],[5.06,5.26],[5.32,5.57],[5.64,6.08],[6.14,6.24],[6.32,7.11]]},{"text":"Ollie returns to his den to rest. Eight arms curl up softly, and the ocean stays calm around him.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.4,0.89],[0.95,1.02],[1.1,1.24],[1.32,1.57],[1.65,1.74],[1.83,2.31],[2.69,3],[3.06,3.46],[3.55,3.88],[3.95,4.06],[4.14,4.81],[5.02,5.21],[5.27,5.34],[5.43,5.8],[5.88,6.26],[6.34,6.7],[6.78,7.17],[7.26,7.89]]}]}